## PR Title
Fix AxSIZE calculation

## PR Description
"Fixes #2"

The change replaces the buggy `DATA_WIDTH >> 4` calculation for the AXI `AWSIZE`/`ARSIZE` registers with `$clog2(DATA_WIDTH)-3`, so the encoded transfer size is correct for data widths other than 32 bits.

